  "title": "Easy Sheet Pan Shrimp Fajitas",
  "description": "Seasoned shrimp and vegetables are baked together on a sheet pan while tortillas warm in the microwave for these easy weeknight fajitas.",
  "authors": [
    "FrackFamily5 CACT"
  ],
